<BaseLayout title = "Video Games - GeneSite" description = "GeneSite - A rant about video games">

<noscript>
        <div class = "no-js">
            <p>Heads up, your JavaScript is off!!!</p>
        </div>
    </noscript>
    <article>
            <section>
                <p>So are videogames healthy? Has my upbringing in life been created
                    as a result of unhealthy videogame playtime? Is it horrendous
                    that I did not learn that the words <strong>highschool</strong>
                    or <strong>videogame</strong> exist until 11th grade and are merely two words jammed
                    together like forcing puzzles to work with a gallon of glue and a dream? Perhaps so.
                    Nevertheless, video game were a huge part of growing up and really 
                    influenced my decision in picking computer science as my major.
                </p>
            </section>
        </article>
</BaseLayout>
